<title>BELGIUM: EU awards Cuban soyoil, rape oil food aid tenders.</title>
<headline>EU awards Cuban soyoil, rape oil food aid tenders.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union awarded tenders to supply 155 tonnes of soyoil and 225 tonnes of rapeseed oil as food aid to Cuba at respectively 701 ecus and 697 ecus a tonne fob, the EU Official Journal said.</p>
<p>The food aid, which will be distributed through Euronaid, is due to be delivered to the port of shipment between July 21 and August 10.</p>
<p>Both tenders were awarded to Antwerp-based Cebag.</p>
<p>-Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
